              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Case #: {{{Case.CaseNumber}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><font color="#000000" face="Aptos"><span style="font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><b>Subject: {{{Case.Subject}}}</b></span></font></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Issue Description: {{{Case.Issue_Description__c}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">-----------------------------------------------------</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">您好 {{{Case.First_Name__c}}}，感谢您联系我们!</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">我们已经接受您针对订单 #{{{Case.Order_Number__c}}} 中商品 [SKU#] 的退货申请，您可以依照下列说明完成退货程序：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><strong>退货说明：</strong></p>
                      <div style="list-style-type:disc">
                       - <strong>退货编号：</strong><br /> 您的退货号 {{{Case.CaseNumber}}} <br /> - <strong>需附文件：</strong><br /> 请将收据副本放入包裹内，如无收据，请在干净纸上注明退货编号、订单编号及您的联系方式，以便处理退货相关事宜。 <br /><strong>- 商品：</strong><br /> 退货商品须保持未开封状态。若商品已开封或在运输途中受损，我们可能会拒绝退货申请或收取5-15%的回置费用，请务必妥善包装后寄回，以确保商品完整。 <br /><strong>- 退款时间：</strong><br /> 约2-3周。 <br /><strong>- 退货地址：</strong><br /><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">  </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hsu’s Ginseng Return Dept.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">  237895 County Road W</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">  Wausau, WI 54403 USA</span></span></span></span></span></span>
                      </div></td>
                    </tr>
                   
